  "_about": "Rally cluster, generated by design/gen_rally.py (edit that and regenerate): a segmented rev arc sweeping across the top under the hood's curve (white, rally yellow from the shift zone, red and flashing at the redline), a huge gear in the middle (red at the shift point) with the drive mode over it and the speed under it, a G-meter on the left (the dot at the lateral and longitudinal g with a fading trail, the outline of the most g this drive in every direction, its range from the G-meter tab; the side and fore / aft g under it, then the best of the drive and the range), boost with a peak-hold bar and three one-line readout slots (oil, coolant, fuel) on the right. Ends 16 px over BMW's own bottom strip, which shows under it. Clear of BMW's black box and belt light. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
